At the moment in the agent class, we instantiate at most two LLMs - one for the agent and optionally one for the condenser that's initialized inside the agent. Previously the agent and condenser would construct their own LLM objects as needed from the their corresponding configs. Now, we pass a registry which gets used to create the agent's llm and the same registry is passed into the condenser to create another optional llm.

